  "description": "Bundled .wit scripts for the OutWit.Controller.Visualization.ParaView controller — RenderParaViewFrames (validate → split into per-timestep tasks with attachment subsets → Grid.ForEach ParaView.RenderFrame → ordered frame set), RenderParaViewStill (one image), RenderParaViewVideo (frames encoded through Render.EncodeVideo; requires the Render controller), ValidateParaViewScene (the validation report alone, for initiators that preflight a package), and — from 0.2.0 — the composed-scene entry points for bare data: RenderParaViewDataStill/Frames/Video and ValidateParaViewData (Grid.Delegate ParaView.Compose builds the state on one node, then the same chain).",
